5,0,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play! Let's all try our best to find the werewolf, okay? Does anyone have any good ideas on how we should start?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Let's keep things simple for now. Since it's Day 0, we have no information. I suggest we observe each other's reactions and speech patterns before making any hasty conclusions.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Toshio. Since we have no data yet, rushing into accusations would be illogical. Let's use this time to establish a baseline for how everyone communicates. Does anyone have a specific strategy in mind?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. Since we lack information, we should focus on identifying contradictions in our statements as the game progresses. Let's maintain a logical approach and avoid emotional reactions.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,It seems we are all in agreement. Let's keep it clinical. I'll be watching closely to see who deviates from their baseline once the real pressure starts. I'm looking forward to seeing how you all handle yourselves.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Everyone sounds so serious! It's like a real detective movie! @Toshio, @Mizuki, @Asuka, @Shion, you're all so smart. I'll be watching too, but I'll do it with a big smile! Who's the most nervous right now?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki"",""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"Nervousness is subjective and often a mask. I am not particularly nervous, but I am curious to see who will try to play a role to hide their identity. Let's continue observing.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, your energy is refreshing, but let's not let it distract us. @Toshio is right; masks are common in this game. I'll be focusing on the consistency of our logic as the days progress.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, your enthusiasm is noted, but focusing on nervousness is inefficient. It's more productive to analyze the structure of our arguments. I will be monitoring for any sudden shifts in behavior or logic.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your attempt to lighten the mood is predictable. While you play the innocent, I'll be analyzing whether that cheerfulness is a genuine trait or a calculated shield. Let's see who cracks first.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, that's mean! I'm just being me! But if you're watching me so closely, maybe you're the one who's nervous? Hehe! Does anyone else think Shion is being a bit too scary?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, @Shion. Let's not get distracted by personal dynamics. While Shion's tone is blunt, it doesn't provide any evidence of their role. We should remain focused on the objective.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio is correct. While Shion's approach is aggressive, it's not evidence of guilt. Let's avoid getting caught up in emotional disputes. It's more important that we all stay focused on the logical flow of the game.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Toshio and Mizuki. Emotional reactions are irrelevant to the objective. @Rin, please try to stay focused. We should use the remaining turns to consider how we will handle the information provided by the Seer tomorrow.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, a practical suggestion. The Seer's information will be the only concrete lead we have. I'm curious to see who will be the first to claim the role—or who will try to fake it.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'll be thinking hard about that! I want to help everyone, so I'll be very careful with my secrets. Let's all have a good night's sleep and see what happens tomorrow! Good luck, everyone!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Toshio,,Good night. I will be reflecting on today's interactions. Let us hope the Seer finds a useful lead tonight. I look forward to seeing how the dynamics shift tomorrow.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
