23,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,Good night. I'll be analyzing the patterns we've established today to see how they evolve tomorrow. Let's hope for a productive first divination.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
