25,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Good night. I will be reviewing today's dialogue to ensure I have a clear baseline for everyone. Let's see who the Seer chooses to investigate.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
