27,0,4,talk,Shion,,"Good night. I've already begun mapping out your patterns. I wonder who will be the first to stumble when the truth starts to emerge tomorrow. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
